            <ArticleTitle>Vascular brachytherapy for treatment of cardiac allograft vasculopathy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>792-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A high restenosis rate often follows treatment of coronary stenoses in cardiac allograft vasculopathy. We report successful coronary brachytherapy of a second in-stent restenosis in a patient after heart transplantation.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
